PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786457920
OL,3,CAll Saints, Blur and DJ Fat Tony pay
OL,4,Ctribute to acclaimed producer William
OL,5,COrbit
OL,7,FThe star shared a photo of herself and
OL,8,Fher bandmates in the studio with
OL,9,FOrbit, and wrote: "I absolutely love
OL,10,Fthe music he made with Madonna and
OL,11,Ffelt so lucky when he worked with All
OL,12,FSaints.
OL,14,F"We were fortunate enough to work with
OL,15,Fhim on many occasions and on many
OL,16,Fsongs.
OL,18,F"In the studio, he made me feel so
OL,19,Fconfident, comfortable and always
OL,20,Fbrought the best out in me.
OL,26,@qD@SOUvD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786457920
OL,3,CAll Saints, Blur and DJ Fat Tony pay
OL,4,Ctribute to acclaimed producer William
OL,5,COrbit
OL,7,F"He was a treasure in the music
OL,8,Findustry and we had the most amazing
OL,9,Ftimes in the studio and socially. We
OL,10,Fwill forever celebrate him as a music
OL,11,Ficon."
OL,13,FFellow All Saints star Melanie Blatt
OL,14,Fjoined the tributes, remembering Orbit
OL,15,Fas "such an important part of our
OL,16,Fsuccess and history".
OL,18,FCelebrity DJ Fat Tony, born Tony
OL,19,FMarnach, shared a photo of the Grammy-
OL,20,Fwinner and wrote: "This really hurts.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@FO]wD@DOUxD@TO]|D@SOU
