OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786457920
OL,3,CAll Saints, Blur and DJ Fat Tony pay
OL,4,Ctribute to acclaimed producer William
OL,5,COrbit
OL,7,FThe band honoured the producer by
OL,8,Fsharing the cover art of the album in
OL,9,Fa post on Instagram with a heartbroken
OL,10,Femoji and "William Orbit" written in
OL,11,Fthe caption.
OL,13,FMusician and DJ Stuart Price, famed
OL,14,Ffor his collaborations with Madonna,
OL,15,Fshared a lengthy tribute to Instagram
OL,16,Fpraising Orbit as "kind to me,
OL,17,Finquisitive, encouraging, deferential,
OL,18,Fsuggestive".
OL,26,@rD@KOUrD@YO]xD@SOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/12
